%% Sarah AI: one inbound SMS turn, from webhook to audit.
%% Deterministic steps are rectangles; the only LLM step is the agent loop.
flowchart TD
    W[SMS webhook] --> V{HMAC signature valid? timing-safe}
    V -- no --> R[Reject + log]
    V -- yes --> D[Deterministic routers]
    D -->|STOP / QUIT / natural-language revocation| S[Upsert suppression, single ack after commit]
    D -->|YES to a pending intent| X[Execute confirmed intent in a transaction]
    D -->|suppressed / DNC| N[No reply]
    D -->|other| Q[Ack fast, per-conversation turn queue]
    Q --> I[Identity resolution: no match / single / multiple]
    I --> P[Compose prompt: base persona + flag-gated policy sections]
    P --> L[[LLM tool loop: temp 0.2, no parallel tools, tool-call breaker]]
    L --> T[Tool registry: zod schema, autonomy gate, guard, execute]
    T -->|read| DB[(Schedule DB)]
    T -->|write| PI[Pending intent: Reply YES to confirm]
    L --> G[Post-model guards: grounded confirmation, value gate, URL allow-list]
    G -->|guard fired| RD[Redraft, original draft stored encrypted]
    RD --> L
    G --> O[Send reply]
    O --> A[(Turn audit: tool calls, results, guard decisions, model, prompt version)]
    X --> DB
